    "message": "ci: bump actions/checkout v4.4.0 -> v7.0.1 (node24)\n\nv4.4.0 runs on node20 and triggers the deprecation warning in every CI log.\nFacts checked before the bump (not from memory):\n- v5.0.0 moved to node24 and requires runner >= 2.327.1; GitHub-hosted\n  ubuntu-latest runners are far newer, so the jump is safe.\n- v6.0.0 changed how persisted credentials are stored; every checkout here\n  uses persist-credentials: false, so the change is not observable.\n- v7.0.x blocks fork-PR checkouts for pull_request_target/workflow_run; this\n  workflow triggers on push/pull_request within the same repo only.\nPinned by SHA per the file's P2 hygiene rule, in all three jobs.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
